• Slavic Village Demonstration, $147,776. Located at East 7th, East 78th, and Morgana Run Trail, this project includes three rain gardens on properties that are vacant or owned by land banks.
• Fleet Avenue, $1,300,000, Located at Fleet Avenue between East 49th and East 65th in Cleveland, the project will include new storm sewers and a retention basin.
• Urban Agriculture Innovation Zone, $5,607,126. Located at East 80th through East 84th streets off Cleveland's Kinsman Road, the project will include new storm sewers and retention basins.
• Fairhill/MLK, $5,281,145. Located at Fairhill Road and Martin Luther King Boulevard in Cleveland's Ambler Park, the project includes new storm sewers and a retention basin.
• East 140th, $6,282,923. Located at East 140th Street and Aspinwall Avenue in Cleveland, the project will include new storm sewers and retention basins.
